# Redirects for AIToolsNova - Cloudflare Pages
# Canonicalize URL variants to prevent Google Search Console
# "Duplicate without user-selected canonical" errors.

# Force single canonical entry-point

# Trailing-slash normalization for known folders
# ============================================
# CANONICAL HOST - www -> non-www (GSC duplicate content fix)
# Both www and apex were serving 200, splitting ranking signals.
# ============================================
# NOTE: Pages _redirects cannot match on hostname. The www -> apex 301 must be
# created as a Cloudflare **Redirect Rule** in the dashboard (see CLOUDFLARE-GSC-ADSENSE.md).

/tools/                                /tools                           301
/blogs/                                /blogs                           301
/blog/                                 /blogs                           301

# Common typo redirects (avoid soft-404s)
/tool                                  /tools                           301
/blog-list                             /blogs                           301
/contact-us                            /contact                         301
/about-us                              /about                           301

# ============================================
# Legacy / old-WordPress URLs (from GSC "Not found 404" report - Aug 2026)
# ============================================

